#: addons/bbcs-firewall-export/views/settings.php:30
msgid "Exports the active BotBlocker ban list as ready-to-use firewall rules for Apache (.htaccess Require not ip / Deny from), nginx (deny list), fail2ban (persistent jail installer script), and iptables/ip6tables (dedicated DROP chain script). Permanent and temporary blocks are taken from the IP rules database; expired bans are never included. Download the format you need and deploy it on the front-end server or edge firewall."
msgstr "Esporta la lista di ban attiva di BotBlocker come regole del firewall pronte all’uso per Apache (.htaccess Require not ip / Deny from), nginx (deny list), fail2ban (script di installazione della jail persistente) e iptables/ip6tables (script dedicato della catena DROP). I blocchi permanenti e temporanei vengono presi dal database delle regole IP; i ban scaduti non vengono mai inclusi. Scaricare il formato necessario e distribuirlo sul server frontend o sul firewall perimetrale."

